{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the dinosaur Archie. Fight through the different arenas and survive until the end to be crowned The Champion and earn your freedom back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2727 The different Arenas\u00a0\u2727</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843700/extras/b8ac28f089cbfbb3f36db2ae07fc5abf.avif?t=1771964647\" width=833 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each arena is unique and has their own challenges. Explore the different biomes and what makes them special.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2727 Objectives\u00a0\u2727</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843700/extras/586a90b0e246ce96f633a7bca25ec2bc.avif?t=1771964647\" width=833 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only is the goal to survive the enemy waves, some arenas will also challenge you in other ways. Capture the flag or an area are some of the things that will be necessary to complete an arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2727 Craft your weapons \u2727</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843700/extras/e349403cbceec582eac83a28504b6753.avif?t=1771964647\" width=833 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you think the emperor was a merciful leader? No! You will be given no weapons to fight with, in the arena you will have to craft them yourself. Combine two different pickups to create your weapon.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2727 Skilltree\u00a0\u2727</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843700/extras/f2b6287bb205efbe1c106c7e959874d8.avif?t=1771964647\" width=833 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what style of combat suits you best. With the different skilltrees you will have multiple skills to evolve so you get to play the way you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wait, Why am I doing this?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh\u2026 Well you don't really have a choice. The emperor has captured you and the only way out is to fight or give up! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2843700?t=1771964647","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2843700?t=1771964647","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843700/891912302422d21fb44dbf9a76c4cfef7d2aa580/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771964647","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843700/891912302422d21fb44dbf9a76c4cfef7d2aa580/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771964647","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4419500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the dinosaur Archie. Fight through the different arenas and survive until the end to be crowned The Champion and earn your freedom back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2727 The different Arenas\u00a0\u