c106c7e959874d8.avif?t=1771964647\" width=833 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what style of combat suits you best. With the different skilltrees you will have multiple skills to evolve so you get to play the way you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wait, Why am I doing this?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh\u2026 Well you don't really have a choice. The emperor has captured you and the only way out is to fight or give up! </p>","developers":["TrebleHookGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843700/b37af52b6b5e2a9b7eafe4ee4963495d7bdb3bd4/header.jpg?t=1771964647","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Quad-Core, 2.7 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 660 / RX 460<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Gamepad or Controller Recommended</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2843700/1721744829/aed8f385380e9c05605748baadeecf89ef34c9e1/1771962687/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771964646","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2843700/1721744829/aed8f385380e9c05605748baadeecf89ef34c9e1/1771962687/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771964646","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2843700/1721744829/aed8f385380e9c05605748baadeecf89ef34c9e1/1771962687/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771964646","id":257293882,"name":"Korinki Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257293882/db1cbbe5b31d35352174d5cfc6fc0f188